<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 582.83, up 1.48.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 265 to 245.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.04.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 16,507,430, compared with 10,742,770 in an abbreviated session on Tuesday. U.S. financial markets were closed Wednesday, Christmas Day.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
